OL,3,GNEWSAEight-year-old boy runs 32 miles
OL,4,Aand scales 15 summits in a single day
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eight-year-old boy has completed one
OL,7,Fof the UK's epic mountain challenges in
OL,8,Funder 16 hours.
OL,10,FBenji, from Llanberis, Gwynedd, ran the
OL,11,FWelsh 3000s in Eryri, also known as
OL,12,FSnowdonia, covering 32 miles (50km), 15
OL,13,Fsummits, and nearly 4,000m (13,000ft)
OL,14,Fof total ascent in 15 hours and 58
OL,15,Fminutes.
OL,17,FMum Toni Howden, who is an outdoor
OL,18,Finstructor, has been taking her son out
OL,19,Fin the mountains since he was a baby.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
