OL,3,GNEWSAEight-year-old boy runs 32 miles
OL,4,Aand scales 15 summits in a single day
OL,5,
OL,6,FBenji said he loved running and being
OL,7,Foutdoors in the mountains, but his main
OL,8,Faim was to raise as much money as he
OL,9,Fcould for the mountain rescue
OL,10,Forganisation.
